// Overdrive  [audioEffect] — tanh saturation, drive 1 to 50, with the makeup gain that keeps ±1 in at ±1 out.
// Note that 0 is NOT clean: tanh(x) already rounds the peaks.
// Its DSP is described in jsdsp.ts beside this file, not compiled into the engine.
plugin({ type: "jsdsp", name: "Overdrive" })
params({ Amount: 0 })
// Soft-clipping through tanh. Amount drives the curve from 1 to 50; the makeup gain compensates the quiet end, where tanh's own slope costs 2.4 dB. Never clips hard, so a chain can follow it without a limiter.
